 "You're not alone, Nanay. Keep your checkup notes, vaccination dates and baby's growth records close—with help from your barangay health worker.":'Hindi ka nag-iisa, Nanay. Balikan ang mga tala ng checkup, petsa ng bakuna at paglaki ni baby—kasama ang inyong barangay health worker.',
