 'Sign in while you have internet. Wait for “Offline ready” and confirmation that a private copy is saved on your device before going offline.':'Mag-sign in habang may internet. Hintaying maging “Handa nang gamitin offline” ang app at makumpirmang may pribadong kopya sa device bago mawalan ng koneksyon.',
